<title>USA: Readers Digest unit names Scimone president.</title>
<headline>Readers Digest unit names Scimone president.</headline>
<dateline>PLEASANTVILLE, N.Y 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reader's Digest Asscociation Inc on Friday said George S. Scimone has been promoted to president of its Reader's Digest U.S.A. unit, effective Nov. 1.</p>
<p>Scimone has been corporate vice president and controller since September 1995, and succeeds Robert J. Aubin, whose resignation for personal reasons also is effective Nov. 1.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
